                                                "example_id": "eb16429e-525f-4ca3-a22e-1b09bd2ed688",
                                                "sense_id": "02fc4e76-a553-37da-bb1c-08248a4f9142",
                                                "text": "Enkidu expresses the values of nature, matrilineal conservatism, and the populism of the assembly, the assembly of village elders from the days before military dictatorship."
